{
  "info": {
    "name": "SweetStop POS API",
    "_postman_id": "9b8ecf3a-f2b8-4f3a-98f7-d2996a4f6f91",
    "description": "Postman collection for SweetStop POS modular APIs (`/api/v1`).\n\nRecommended run order for first-time setup:\n1. Health Check\n2. Branches > Create Branch\n3. Access > List Roles (captures role IDs)\n4. Access > Create Account (captures account IDs)\n5. Access > Assign Branch Role\n6. Catalog > Create Product\n7. Catalog > Create Variant\n8. Catalog > Update Branch Variant Config\n9. Catalog > Update Branch Variant Inventory\n10. POS > Create Receipt\n11. Cash > Create Cash Movement\n12. Reports > Generate Daily Report\n\nThe collection uses collection variables and test scripts to auto-store generated IDs.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "description": "Checks if server is up.",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Branches",
      "description": "Branch management module. Create a branch first and capture `branchId`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Branches",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Lists all branches.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/branches"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Branch By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Gets one branch by `branchId` variable.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/branches/{{branchId}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Branch",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 201\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"branchId\", json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Creates a branch and stores its ID to `branchId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"SweetStop - Manila Main\",\n  \"address\": \"123 Dessert Street, Manila\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Manila\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/branches"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Access",
      "description": "User access control module. Run `List Roles` before update/assign calls to populate role ID variables.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Authenticates user and stores `authToken` for protected endpoints.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"{{defaultPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 200\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"authToken\", json.data.token);",
                  "}",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.profile && json.data.profile.account_id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accountId\", json.data.profile.account_id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cashierAccountId\", json.data.profile.account_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Bootstrap Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Creates the very first admin account. This only works when no accounts exist yet.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/bootstrap/admin",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstname\": \"Admin\",\n  \"lastname\": \"Owner\",\n  \"gender\": \"PREFER_NOT_TO_SAY\",\n  \"birthdate\": \"1995-01-01\",\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"contact_no\": \"+639171234567\",\n  \"email_address\": \"admin@sweetstop.test\",\n  \"password\": \"{{defaultPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Returns current authenticated account context.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/me"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Roles",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 200\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const rows = (json && json.data) || [];",
                  "const byCode = {};",
                  "rows.forEach((r) => { byCode[r.code] = r.id; });",
                  "if (byCode.cashier !== undefined) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cashierRoleId\", String(byCode.cashier));",
                  "if (byCode.manager !== undefined) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"managerRoleId\", String(byCode.manager));",
                  "if (byCode.admin !== undefined) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"adminRoleId\", String(byCode.admin));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Lists roles and captures `cashierRoleId`, `managerRoleId`, and `adminRoleId`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/roles"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Permissions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Lists all permission keys.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/permissions"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Accounts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Lists accounts for all branches or for a specific branch using `branchId`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/accounts?branch_id={{branchId}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Account",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 201\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.account && json.data.account.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accountId\", json.data.account.id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"cashierAccountId\", json.data.account.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Creates a test cashier account and stores `accountId` and `cashierAccountId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstname\": \"Cashier\",\n  \"lastname\": \"Tester\",\n  \"gender\": \"PREFER_NOT_TO_SAY\",\n  \"birthdate\": \"1998-01-01\",\n  \"username\": \"cashier_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"contact_no\": \"+639171234567\",\n  \"email_address\": \"cashier_{{$timestamp}}@sweetstop.test\",\n  \"access_code\": \"cashier\",\n  \"password\": \"{{defaultPassword}}\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/accounts"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Account Access",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Updates the global access role for `accountId` using captured `managerRoleId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"access_id\": {{managerRoleId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/accounts/{{accountId}}/access"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign Branch Role",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Assigns a branch-specific role for `accountId` in `branchId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"branch_id\": \"{{branchId}}\",\n  \"access_id\": {{cashierRoleId}},\n  \"is_primary\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/access/accounts/{{accountId}}/branch-role"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalog",
      "description": "Catalog and branch customization module. Create product and variant first.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Products (Global)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Lists global products and variants without branch overlay.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Products (Branch View)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Lists products with branch-level config and inventory.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products?branch_id={{branchId}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Product",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 201\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"productId\", json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Creates a product and stores `productId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"category\": \"Ice Cream\",\n  \"name\": \"Classic Sundae\",\n  \"photo_url\": \"https://images.example.com/sundae.jpg\",\n  \"description\": \"Vanilla sundae base product.\",\n  \"is_active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Variant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status is 201\", function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"variantId\", json.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Creates a variant under `productId` and stores `variantId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Regular Cup\",\n  \"sku\": \"SUNDAE-REG-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"description\": \"Regular serving size\",\n  \"tags\": {\n    \"size\": \"regular\",\n    \"temperature\": \"cold\"\n  },\n  \"is_active\": true,\n  \"default_price\": 129\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog/products/{{productId}}/variants"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Branch Variant Config",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{authToken}}",
